AgntAndroid
===========

This directory is derived from the Android client in the Remodex project,
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Upstream source: Stivy-01/remodex (https://github.com/Stivy-01/remodex)
  fork of: Emanuele-web04/remodex (https://github.com/Emanuele-web04/remodex)
Imported from:   Stivy-01/remodex@main, directory `android/`

Modifications relative to upstream:
  - Package and namespace renamed from `com.remodex.mobile` to
    `com.smeltery.agnt.mobile`; classes prefixed with `Remodex` renamed to
    `Agnt` to match the rest of this repository.
  - Secure-transport identifiers updated to match agnt-bridge:
      remodex-e2ee-v1                       -> agnt-e2ee-v1
      remodex-trusted-session-resolve-v1    -> agnt-trusted-session-resolve-v1
      refs/remodex/checkpoints              -> refs/agnt/checkpoints
  - Env-var prefix updated: PHODEX_DEFAULT_RELAY_URL -> AGNT_DEFAULT_RELAY_URL.
  - User-facing strings rebranded to "agnt".
  - Build typo (orphaned `sionCode = 7`) removed; version reset to 0.1.0.

